The bus reaches the junction.
I need to get off here.
The bus stops.
I carefully step off the bus.
I see the metro station in front of me.
I quickly walk to the station.
I enter the station.
It is very quiet there.
It is also very cool inside.
The outside heat is not here.
There are many people in the station.
But there is no commotion at all.
I need to board the metro train.
First, I need to get a ticket.
